<view class="page"><text class="kicker">A LITTLE PERSPECTIVE / 03</text><text class="title">心里有问，<text class="break">翻开一页。</text></text><text class="subtitle">留一点空白，让另一种想法进来。</text><view class="book"><text class="book-no">{{selected?selected.id:'THE BOOK OF ANSWERS'}}</text><text class="book-answer">{{selected?selected.text:'先在心里，\n想一个问题。'}}</text><text class="book-detail" wx:if="{{selected}}">{{selected.phone_detail}}</text><button class="primary" bindtap="draw" loading="{{drawing}}" disabled="{{drawing}}">{{selected?'再翻一页':'翻开答案'}}</button><text class="note">手机随机翻页 · 不会改变设备上的内容</text></view><text class="section-title">找回那一句话</text><input class="field" placeholder="搜索关键词或编号，例如 OB005" value="{{query}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="120"/><text class="note">共 {{items.length}} 条答案</text><view class="answer-row" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><button class="answer-toggle" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="expand"><text class="answer-id">{{item.id}}</text><text>{{item.text}}</text><text class="answer-arrow">{{opened===item.id?'−':'+'}}</text></button><text wx:if="{{opened===item.id}}" class="answer-detail">{{item.phone_detail}}</text></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!items.length}}">没有找到这句话，试试更短的关键词。</view></view>
